  <running_head>HORRENDA EXEMPLA</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">Quis est homo, q nō flẽret</l>
    <l n="2">Matrē Christi, si videret</l>
    <l n="3">In tanto supplicio?</l>
    <l n="4">Quis nō posset cōtristari,</l>
    <l n="5">Piam matrē contemplari,</l>
    <l n="6">Dolentem cum Filio.</l>
    <l n="7">Pro peccatis suæ gentis</l>
    <l n="8">Vidit Iesum in tormētis,</l>
    <l n="9">Et flagellis subditum,</l>
    <l n="10">Videns suum dulcē Natū</l>
    <l n="11">Morientem desolatum</l>
    <l n="12">Cūm emisit Spiritum.</l>
    <l n="13">Eja mater fons amoris,</l>
    <l n="14">Me sentire vim doloris</l>
    <l n="15">Fac ut tecum lugeam,</l>
    <l n="16">Fac ut ardeat cor meum,</l>
    <l n="17">In amādo Christum Deū,</l>
    <l n="18">Ut sibi complaceam.</l>
    <l n="19">Sancta mater istud agas,</l>
    <l n="20">Crucifixi fige plagas,</l>
    <l n="21">Cordi meo valide</l>
    <l n="22">Tui Nati vulnerati</l>
    <l n="23">Iām dignāri pro me pati,</l>
    <l n="24">Pœnās mecum divide.</l>
    <l n="25">Fac me vere te cum flere,</l>
    <l n="26">Crucifixo condolere,</l>
    <l n="27">Donec ego vixero,</l>
    <l n="28">Iuxta crucem tecum stare,</l>
    <l n="29">Et me tibi sociare</l>
    <l n="30">In planctu desidero.</l>
    <l n="31">Virgo virginum præclara,</l>
    <l n="32">Mihi iam non fis amara</l>
    <l n="33">Fac me tecum plangere,</l>
    <l n="34">Fac ut portē Christi mortem</l>
    <l n="35">Passionis ejus fortem (te</l>
    <l n="36">Et plagas recolere.</l>
    <l n="37">Fac me plagis vulnerari</l>
    <l n="38">Utiq; fac me beari</l>
    <l n="39">Cum cruore filii;</l>
    <l n="40">Inflammatus ac incensus</l>
    <l n="41">Per te, virgo, sim defensus</l>
    <l n="42">In die judicii.</l>
    <l n="43">Fac me custodiri;</l>
    <l n="44">Morte Christi præmuniri</l>
    <l n="45">Confoveri gratia,</l>
    <l n="46">Quādo corpus morietur,</l>
    <l n="47">Fac ut animæ donetur</l>
    <l n="48">Paradisi gloria. Amen.</l>
    <l n="49">ALIA.</l>
    <l n="50">Ave mundi spes Maria,</l>
    <l n="51">Ave mitis, ave pia,</l>
    <l n="52">Ave plena gratia.</l>
    <l n="53">Ave virgo Mater Christi,</l>
    <l n="54">Tu quæ sola meruisti</l>
    <l n="55">Esse mater sine viro,</l>
    <l n="56">Et lactare more miro.</l>
    <l n="57">Angelorum imperatrix</l>
    <l n="58">Peccatorum consolatrix,</l>
    <l n="59">Consolare me lugentem</l>
    <l n="60">In peccatis iam fœtentem.</l>
    <l n="61" type="foot" para="true">Consola</l>
  </main_text>
